// 005.10 (D35, #37): on a `Power`, `Finding`, or `Amend` that omits `Holds when`, `Holds when`
// defaults to `Valid when` so the single competence condition governs both lawfulness and validity.
Fact person Identified by Alice, Bob
Bool ready
Bool granted
Power grant Actor person Valid when person == Alice && ready() Creates granted()
.
?!lawful grant(Alice).
?!valid grant(Alice).
+ready().
?lawful grant(Alice).
?valid grant(Alice).
?!lawful grant(Bob).
?!valid grant(Bob).
grant(Alice).
?granted().
